#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:2 ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:6
msgid "Multispectral Thermal (PAG7936)"
msgstr "Multispektrális termikus (PAG7936)"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:4
msgid ""
"The PAG7936 variant of the Multispectral Thermal Camera Module pairs a 1 MP "
"global-shutter colour sensor with a FLIR Lepton thermal core, so the OpenMV "
"Cam can run colour-vision and thermal pipelines side by side."
msgstr ""
"A Multispectral Thermal Camera Module PAG7936 változata egy 1 MP-es globális"
" zárú színes érzékelőt párosít egy FLIR Lepton termikus maggal, így az "
"OpenMV Cam egymás mellett futtathat színes és termikus pipeline-okat."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:6
msgid ".. image:: ../pag7936-hero.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../pag7936-hero.jpg"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Multispectral Thermal "
"product page <https://openmv.io/products/multispectral-thermal-camera-"
"module>`_."
msgstr ""
"A teljes adatlapért, fényképekért és rendeléshez lásd a `Multispectral "
"Thermal termékoldalt <https://openmv.io/products/multispectral-thermal-"
"camera-module>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:16
msgid "Supported on the OpenMV N6 only."
msgstr "Csak az OpenMV N6 modellen támogatott."

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Kiemelt jellemzők"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:21
msgid "PAG7936: 1 MP global shutter"
msgstr "PAG7936: 1 MP-es globális zár"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:22
msgid "Accepts FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermal cores"
msgstr "FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x termikus magokat fogad"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:23
msgid "Simultaneous thermal + colour processing on one module"
msgstr "Egyidejű termikus + színes feldolgozás egyetlen modulon"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:24
